      "difficulty": "knowledge-check",
      "stem": "Factorise $x^2 + 2x - 15$.",
      "options": [
        { "id": "a", "text": "$(x + 3)(x - 5)$" },
        { "id": "b", "text": "$(x - 3)(x + 5)$" },
        { "id": "c", "text": "$(x + 1)(x - 15)$" },
        { "id": "d", "text": "$(x - 3)(x - 5)$" }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "b",
      "explanation": "We need two numbers that multiply to $-15$ and add to $+2$. These are $-3$ and $+5$, giving $(x - 3)(x + 5)$."
    },
    {
      "id": "q2",
      "type": "multiple-choice",
      "difficulty": "knowledge-check",
      "stem": "Factorise $x^2 - 49$.",
      "options": [
        { "id": "a", "text": "$(x - 7)(x - 7)$" },
        { "id": "b", "text": "$(x + 7)(x + 7)$" },
        { "id": "c", "text": "$(x + 7)(x - 7)$" },
        { "id": "d", "text": "$(x + 49)(x - 1)$" }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "c",
      "explanation": "This is a difference of two squares: $x^2 - 49 = x^2 - 7^2 = (x + 7)(x - 7)$."
    },
    {
      "id": "q3",
      "type": "multiple-choice",
      "difficulty": "knowledge-check",
      "stem": "Factorise $x^2 - x - 20$.",
