        { "id": "b", "text": "$(x - 4)(x + 5)$" },
        { "id": "c", "text": "$(x - 10)(x + 2)$" },
        { "id": "d", "text": "$(x + 4)(x + 5)$" }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "a",
      "explanation": "We need two numbers that multiply to $-20$ and add to $-1$. These are $+4$ and $-5$, giving $(x + 4)(x - 5)$."
